--- THE SCROLL FORMAT ---
1. Dividers: 20+ hashes (#) mark the start/end of a file.
2. Language Tags: "TRANSLATOR CALL: python/json/text/bash" tells the runtime how to execute the block.
3. Addresses: Coordinates (X, Y, Z) replace file paths. X is the axis (topic), Y is the sequence (thread), Z is depth.
4. Rule: NO REWRITES. The pen writes Y+1 to infinity.

